:Fast_Food_Restaurant rdf:type owl:Class ;
                      rdfs:subClassOf :Restaurant .


###  http://example.org/kr25/restaurant#Fine_Dining_Restaurant
:Fine_Dining_Restaurant rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        rdfs:subClassOf :Restaurant .


###  http://example.org/kr25/restaurant#Ingredient
:Ingredient rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://example.org/kr25/restaurant#Restaurant
:Restaurant rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://example.org/kr25/restaurant#Seafood_Restaurant
:Seafood_Restaurant rdf:type owl:Class ;
                    rdfs:subClassOf :Restaurant .


